p.src:
Now attach $+1$ to the slash outcome and $-1$ to the backslash outcome. The corresponding observable is $\hat P_{\pi/4}
  =\ket{d_+}\bra{d_+}-\ket{d_-}\bra{d_-}
  =
  \begin{pmatrix}
    0&1\\
    1&0
  \end{pmatrix}.$ Exchanging which diagonal outcome is called $+1$ simply replaces this operator by $-\hat P_{\pi/4}$. Indeed, $\hat P_{\pi/4}
  \begin{pmatrix}1\\1\end{pmatrix}
  =
  \begin{pmatrix}1\\1\end{pmatrix},
  \qquad
  \hat P_{\pi/4}
  \begin{pmatrix}1\\-1\end{pmatrix}
  =-
  \begin{pmatrix}1\\-1\end{pmatrix}.$

