Return finally to the axial polarization observable in the state $\ket{\theta}$: $\begin{aligned}
  \expect{\hat P_0}_\theta
  &=
  \bra{\theta}
  \begin{pmatrix}
    1&0\\
    0&-1
  \end{pmatrix}
  \ket{\theta}\\
  &=
  \begin{pmatrix}
    \cos\theta&\sin\theta
  \end{pmatrix}
  \begin{pmatrix}
    \cos\theta\\
    -\sin\theta
  \end{pmatrix}\\
  &=
  \cos^2\theta-\sin^2\theta
  =\cos2\theta.
  \end{aligned}$

